     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Frequency",
     "texto": [
      "**Selalu** means \"always\"; **sering**, \"often\"; **kadang-kadang**, \"sometimes\"; **jarang**, \"rarely\". **Tidak pernah** means \"never\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Household chores",
     "texto": [
      "**Membantu** means \"to help\", **memasak**, \"to cook\", and **membersihkan**, \"to clean\". These forms are learned as complete verbs."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
